{##
 # Standardised Test
 #
 # @param array     externalUser
 # @param int|null  year
 #}
{% include '@templates/Avatar.twig' %}

{% include '@templates/Navigation.twig' with {
    elements: navigation
} %}

{% include '@templates/Navigation.twig' with {
    elements: subnavigation
} %}

<script type="text/javascript" src="/javascript/components/highcharts-release/highcharts.js"></script>

<div class="achievement-report standardised-test">
    {% if writing.visible %}
        <script>
            $(function () {
                var chart = new Highcharts.Chart({
                    chart: {
                        height: 880,
                        reflow: true,
                        renderTo: 'writing',
                        spacingBottom: 30
                    },
                    credits: {
                        enabled: false
                    },
                    legend: {
                        enabled: false
                    },
                    plotOptions: {
                        area: {
                            fillOpacity: 0.2
                        }
                    },
                    series: [

                        {# First set of grey squares #}
                        {
                            data: [{{ writing.data.series.grey1|join(',') }}],
                            enableMouseTracking: false,
                            marker: {
                                radius: 13,
                                fillColor: '#cccccc',
                                symbol: 'square'
                            },
                            states: {
                                inactive: {
                                    opacity: 1.0
                                }
                            },
                            type: 'scatter',
                            yAxis: 1
                        },

                        {# Second set of grey squares #}
                        {
                            data: [{{ writing.data.series.grey2|join(',') }}],
                            enableMouseTracking: false,
                            marker: {
                                radius: 13,
                                fillColor: '#cccccc',
                                symbol: 'square'
                            },
                            states: {
                                inactive: {
                                    opacity: 1.0
                                }
                            },
                            type: 'scatter',
                            yAxis: 1
                        },

                        {# Third set of grey squares #}
                        {
                            data: [{{ writing.data.series.grey3|join(',') }}],
                            enableMouseTracking: false,
                            marker: {
                                radius: 13,
                                fillColor: '#cccccc',
                                symbol: 'square'
                            },
                            states: {
                                inactive: {
                                    opacity: 1.0
                                }
                            },
                            type: 'scatter',
                            yAxis: 1
                        },

                        {# Fourth set of grey squares #}
                        {
                            data: [{{ writing.data.series.grey4|join(',') }}],
                            enableMouseTracking: false,
                            marker: {
                                radius: 13,
                                fillColor: '#cccccc',
                                symbol: 'square'
                            },
                            states: {
                                inactive: {
                                    opacity: 1.0
                                }
                            },
                            type: 'scatter',
                            yAxis: 1
                        },

                        {# Student Data #}
                        {
                            data: [{{ writing.data.series.student|join(',') }}],
                            enableMouseTracking: false,
                            marker: {
                                symbol: 'url(/custom/diocesan/achievementreport/img/star-red.png)'
                            },
                            states: {
                                inactive: {
                                    opacity: 1.0
                                }
                            },
                            type: 'scatter',
                        }
                    ],
                    subtitle: {
                        text: 'Based on Diocesan Reading Expectations for Year 0-6'
                    },
                    title: {
                        text: 'Tracked Achievement Over Time'
                    },
                    tooltip: {
                        enabled: false,
                    },
                    xAxis: {
                        categories: [{{ writing.data.x.categories|purify }}],
                        gridLineWidth: 1,
                        title: {
                            text: 'Time at school',
                            y: 10
                        }
                    },
                    yAxis: [
                        {
                            categories: ['null', {{ writing.data.y.probeAge|purify }}],
                            max: 12,
                            min: 1,
                            title: {
                                text: ''
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            categories: ['null', {{ writing.data.y.colourWheel|purify }}],
                            max: 12,
                            min: 1,
                            offset: 0,
                            title: {
                                text: ''
                            }
                        }
                    ],
                });

                chart.reflow();
            });
        </script>
        <div class="row">
            <div class="small-12 columns">
                <div id="writing"></div>
            </div>
        </div>
    {% endif %}

    <div class="row">
        <div class="small-12 island">
            <section class="content">
                <p>
                    Achievement and progress in writing is assessed using both e-asTTle an online assessment
                    tool designed to assess your daughter's progress in writing from Years 1-6 and overall
                    teacher judgement. When assessing achievement and progress a series of levels are used.
                    These levels go from 1 to 6 and are further broken down into three stages: beginning,
                    proficient and advanced. In order the levels are 1B, 1P, 1A: 2B, 2P, 2A etc.
                </p>

                <p>
                    Through this process teachers develop a rich picture of your daughter's strengths and next
                    learning steps through analysing information from learning conversations, observations of
                    learning tasks or the products of these tasks, and the use of the standardised assessment
                    tool e-asTTle. These methods of assessment can be thought of as a "healthy triangle", with
                    standardised tools (such as e-asTTle) being only a small part of the picture.
                </p>
            </section>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
